  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-24T14:34:43.254Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a large number of avatar creators uploading quest versions of there avatars now. \nI think its A shame PC user's don't have the option to see these avatars as they are already there.\n\n\nAs the title says. I would like to see a option for showing quest versions of avatars where possible.\nSo if a PC avatar has a quest variant the game will use that instead.\n\n\nBenefits\nIts optional\nThis will help people with less powerful PC's\nWill help keep large lobby's playable.\nWill give people more reason to make quest versions of their avatars.\n(Will benefit the quest community.)\n\n\nAny option that makes the game less leggy is a no brainier to me.\n\n\nIf you agree with me pls Up-vote this and share with your friends.\n\n\nI wanted to add more detail to Venclaire's post last year. Up-vote his canny as well if you like this idea.\n\n\nHere are some quickly made image for a idea.\n(this could go anywhere in the menu this is just a idea.)",
